  "description": "Anthropic integration for TokenGuard on .NET 10. Converts prepared TokenGuard messages to Anthropic request parts and lets TokenGuard use Anthropic to summarize older history when context gets tight.",
  "id": "TokenGuard.Extensions.Anthropic",
  "isPrerelease": false,
