  "readmeFile": "PackageReadme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Requires TokenGuard.Core 1.1.0 and Anthropic 12.53.0 or later. The summarizer logs and traces through the logger factory configured on the conversation.\n\nKnown limits: the token counter, summarizer, summary formatter, and builder registration of a custom compaction strategy are closed to consumers; one ConversationContext is for one caller at a time; token estimates leave out request overhead such as tool schemas; the package targets net10.0 only.\n\nFull details: https://github.com/svetstoykov/TokenGuard/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
